 "url": "issues/daily/2026/11/2026-11-15.html",
 "subject": "Alibaba's new top AI model costs less per task",
 "preview": "OpenAI credits its model with the hard part of a physics proof, Apple opens a study of how people trust AI health answers, and Washington reportedly picks its AI champions.",
 "body": "<!-- buttondown-editor-mode: fancy -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">OpenAI credits its model with the hard part of a physics proof, Apple opens a study of how people trust AI health answers, and Washington reportedly picks its AI champions.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">News from Sunday, November 15, 2026 · <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/issues/daily/2026/11/2026-11-15.html\">Read on the web</a></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">What matters today</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/art/2026-11-15-0.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">Cheaper work per task</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen4-max\">Alibaba opens Qwen4-Max, its top model, at a lower cost per task</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Available</strong> on <a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/qwen4-max-now-available-on-ai-gateway\">Vercel's AI Gateway</a> from November 15; Alibaba dates the general release November 16. Reads text and images, up to 1 million tokens; no open weights.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Cost:</strong> on Alibaba's own work test, the average task fell <strong>from 26.58 to 11.16 yuan</strong> against Qwen3.8-Max. <a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/qwen4-max\">Artificial Analysis</a> scores it 43, 38th of 81 models.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Top models now compete on the cost of a finished job, not only the price per token. That is the number to compare when choosing a model for long agent tasks.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/art/2026-11-15-1.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">AI does the hard part of a proof</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/step-toward-defining-the-standard-model\">OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra helps a physicist build a long-sought proof</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>What:</strong> a <strong>candidate way to define the Standard Model of physics on a grid</strong>, open for over 50 years. Nathaniel Craig set the strategy; Astra built the construction and proof.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Stage:</strong> a candidate, not a finished theory; Craig calls it an answer in principle. It is the first post on OpenAI's <a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/our-new-blog-for-science\">new science blog</a>.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Models are now credited with the hard middle of expert work while a person sets direction and checks it. Tools for experts will be judged on how well people can steer and verify.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/covers/2026-11-15-2.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"The Apple Health AI Usage Study app on two iPhones, showing its welcome screen and suggested health questions\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">Image: <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/apple-launches-research-study-to-explore-the-use-of-ai-for-health/\">Apple</a></p><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">Apple tests AI health answers</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/apple-launches-research-study-to-explore-the-use-of-ai-for-health/\">Apple opens a study app that answers health questions with AI</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Who:</strong> up to <strong>200,000 US adults</strong> aged 21 and older with an iPhone 15 Pro or later. Answers come from OpenEvidence, with peer-reviewed sources linked.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>What it measures:</strong> trust, understanding and what people do next. People can choose to share Health data; study data will not train AI models.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Apple tests health answers on real people, with a source on every answer, before calling them a product. In sensitive areas, that kind of evidence may become what buyers and regulators expect.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/art/2026-11-15-3.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">US picks AI champions</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/siladityaray/2026/11/16/scandal-hit-nvidia-among-trumps-planned-ai-national-champions-report-says/\">The US reportedly plans to name AI national champions</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Who:</strong> more than two dozen companies, including Nvidia, Amazon, Microsoft, OpenAI and Anthropic, under the American AI Exports Program set up in July 2025.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>What they get:</strong> faster export licenses, government support for projects abroad and federal financing, per the Commerce Department. An announcement is expected <strong>within a week</strong>.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Washington is choosing which AI vendors it backs abroad. Outside the US, those vendors become the government-backed option, which helps them win deals and makes life harder for smaller rivals.</p></div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Research worth watching</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 18px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2611.16961\">Let a model skip thinking when it does not pay</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">One model either answers at once or reasons step by step, and a small add-on decides per request which is worth the cost. On a web-task test it <strong>cut token cost by 80%</strong>.</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>How much a model thinks becomes a setting a product can price and tune.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 18px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2611.10439\">Share what agents learn without leaking secrets</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">AWS's MixUA turns agent runs into lessons and decides who may see each one. With five users and seven agents it <strong>raised pass rates up to 16 points</strong>, and at most 0.02% of privacy probes found a leak.</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Shared agent memory needs rules on who sees what from the start.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 18px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.41453\">What an agent should do when a tool times out</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">After a timeout, an action may have failed, finished or still be running. Planning advice built on the evidence <strong>safely completed 30 tasks against 9</strong> for plain prompting.</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Agents that act on real systems need a plan for unclear outcomes, not just retries.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 18px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.13920\">Search agents trust bad sources</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">A test that feeds search agents unreliable documents found several open-weight agents <strong>answer confidently despite obvious red flags</strong>, and many answer from memory even when every document is wrong.</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Test an agent with bad sources, not just good ones.</p></div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">What developers are debating</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50507303\">Should AI-written code be open source?</a>: an essay argued that code made by AI from open source training data should be released openly; developers fought over copyright and who owns the output. 1,166 points, 616 comments.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50506376\">How models track word order</a>: an explainer on positional embeddings in modern language models drew developers trading notes on how long-context models handle position. 228 points, 27 comments.</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Top launches yesterday</h2>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/1b629ffb-d0fa-4af3-909c-ff1dd2e8e2f6.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://rakazo.com/\">Rakazo</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">An open-source AI teammate you host yourself, connected to your tools, with your own model keys, approval rules and audit logs.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/b6aa8b30-ad9b-45d2-b62b-d036c7c57a98.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://www.frevana.com/\">Frevana Multiplayer</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">Teams share AI agents and skills by link and build on each other's workflows for finding customers and making content.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/579ddbdd-067a-4677-a193-4b866294bfd0.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://www.tulvo.io/\">Tulvo</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">A small-business workspace for docs, tasks, customers and forms on one dataset, set up by AI from a plain description and open to other AI tools through MCP.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/eddccbb5-2fff-4388-8f7f-adc0e09ff16a.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://www.talyn.dev/\">Talyn</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">Runs Claude Code and Codex in cloud sandboxes to fix failing builds, merge conflicts and review comments while your laptop is closed.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/launch-image-uploads/f5b41999-3ee1-41d7-9081-806d3c18bc8f/6faebf36d9fbfcf5dc981ddbe5919988987199a977b11118aa2a357cf4d8fe90.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://huntmonitor.netlify.app/\">HuntMonitor</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">A live view of the day's launch race, sortable by points, comments and speed of votes.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/bc812260-5303-4a74-93fb-06cc1a79ef6f.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://agentgrid.io/\">Canvas by AgentGrid.io</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">A free design canvas where you and AI agents connected through MCP edit the same real HTML and CSS.</div></td></tr></table>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Also in the news</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/15/apple-smart-glasses-hinge-on-siri/\"><strong>Apple glasses and Siri</strong></a>: reportedly, Apple's first glasses rely on Siri running tasks inside iPhone apps; those app controls are in the first iOS 27.3 beta.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/15/bland-tofu-1-full-duplex-speech-to-speech-model/\"><strong>Bland Tofu-1</strong></a>: a voice model for phone agents that listens and speaks at once and separates callers from background noise; a gated research preview, general release in January.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1033984/congress-export-rules-ai-chips-china\"><strong>AI chip exports</strong></a>: lawmakers of both parties back tighter limits on AI chip sales to China; a bill stalled since April 2025 draws new interest.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://pandaily.com/deepseek-web-frontend-code-quota-management-coding-plan-unannounced\"><strong>DeepSeek Coding Plan</strong></a>: developers found usage-limit code for a 'Coding Plan' in DeepSeek's web chat; DeepSeek has announced no plan, price or date.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://sambanova.ai/blog/the-air-cooled-token-factory-intel-gpu-d-series-sambarack-sn50\"><strong>SambaNova and Intel</strong></a>: a SuperComputing 2026 demo splits AI serving between Intel's air-cooled D-Series GPUs and SambaNova's SN50 chips, for data centers without liquid cooling.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.tokenpost.com/news/technology/57983\"><strong>Huawei Balong AI modem</strong></a>: Huawei says the Kirin 9050's modem flags over 90% of forwarded overseas scam calls.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"border:0;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:32px 0 16px\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">You get the AI Brief because you subscribed at <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/\">ai.mediancanadian.ca</a>. <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\">Unsubscribe</a> at any time; it takes effect at once.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">The AI Brief is from The Median Canadian. Contact: <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"mailto:info@mediancanadian.ca\">info@mediancanadian.ca</a>. <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/privacy.html\">Privacy</a>.</p>\n",
